{"t":"ABNB","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Airbnb, Inc.","ko":"에어비앤비","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","employees":8200,"hq":"San Francisco, CA, United States","website":"https://www.airbnb.com","summary_en":"Airbnb, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates a platform for stays, experiences, and services worldwide. The company's marketplace connects hosts and guests online or through mobile devices to book spaces, experiences, and services. It also offers gift cards. The company was formerly known as AirBed & Breakfast, Inc. and changed its name to Airbnb, Inc. in November 2010. Airbnb, Inc. was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Airbnb, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 전 세계적으로 숙박, 체험, 서비스를 위한 플랫폼을 운영하고 있습니다. 회사의 마켓플레이스는 호스트와 게스트를 온라인이나 모바일 기기를 통해 연결하여 공간, 체험, 서비스를 예약합니다. 기프트 카드도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 AirBed & Breakfast, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2010년 11월에 Airbnb, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Airbnb, Inc.는 2007년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 샌프란시스코에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":183.52,"mcap":109514129408.0,"pe":34.431522,"fpe":29.063314,"peg":1.5522,"ps":7.860054,"pb":11.607843,"ev_ebitda":30.596,"div":0.0,"beta":1.272,"hi52":197.87,"lo52":110.81},"fin":{"rev":13932999680.0,"rev_g":0.189,"eps_g":0.427,"gross":0.83119005,"op":0.22493,"net":0.23017,"roe":0.35788,"fcf":3249999872.0,"cash":12590000128.0,"debt":2515000064.0,"de":27.008,"eps":5.33,"feps":6.31449},"own":{"short":0.031,"inst":0.90330005,"insider":0.01918},"analyst":{"n":40,"mean":203.8295,"median":210.0,"high":245.0,"low":147.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.93182,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":22,"hold":17,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":22,"hold":16,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":21,"hold":16,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":21,"hold":18,"sell":2,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Bu